  "title": {
    "zh": "儿童夜光拼插积木帐篷套装",
    "en": "Kids Glow Fort Building Set"
  },
  "summary": {
    "zh": "这是一款儿童夜光拼插积木帐篷套装，采用PP结构件，适用于亲子互动、课堂活动和创意搭建场景。\n\n品牌为尧顺，产地东莞茶山，支持拆装房子与夜光场景玩法。",
    "en": "This is a kids glow fort building set made with PP structural parts, suitable for parent-child interaction, classroom activities, and creative construction scenarios.\n\nBrand: Yaoshun. Origin: Chashan, Dongguan. It supports detachable-house layouts and glow-themed play."
  },
  "description": {
    "zh": [
      "该款儿童夜光拼插积木帐篷套装采用模块化拼接结构，可围绕帐篷、通道和互动空间进行多形态搭建，适合持续创意构建。",
      "产品兼顾日常拼搭与夜光展示效果，适用于亲子互动、课程教具和活动场景，支持反复拆装与组合。",
      "包装为彩盒，提供双体积方案、尺寸与重量参数，便于渠道陈列、仓配管理和项目采购。"
    ],
    "en": [
      "This kids glow fort building set uses a modular interlocking structure and supports multiple layouts around tents, tunnels, and interactive spaces for continuous creative construction play.",
      "It combines daily construction play with glow display effects, suitable for parent-child interaction, educational props, and event scenarios with repeatable assembly.",
      "The set uses color-box packaging and provides dual volume options plus size and weight data for channel display, warehouse operations, and project procurement."
    ]
  },
